       ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮       
       │                                                                                    │       
       │   Move                                                                             │       
       │     j/↓          down                                                              │       
       │     k/↑          up                                                                │       
       │     J/pgdn/space page down                                                         │       
       │     K/pgup       page up                                                           │       
       │     ctrl-d       half a page down                                                  │       
       │     ctrl-u       half a page up                                                    │       
       │     gg           top                                                               │       
       │     G            bottom                                                            │       
       │     h/←          pane to the left                                                  │       
       │     l/→          pane to the right                                                 │       
       │     enter        open                                                              │       
       │     esc          back; clear selection or search                                   │       
       │     n            next conversation (reader)                                        │       
       │     p            previous conversation (reader)                                    │       
       │                                                                                    │       
       │   Act on the conversation (or the selected ones)                                   │       
       │     a            archive                                                           │       
       │     dd           move to Trash                                                     │       
       │     I            move to Inbox                                                     │       
       │     N            mark read / unread                                                │       
       │     *            star / unstar                                                     │       
       │     x            select (then act on all selected)                                 │       
       │     u            undo the last change                                              │       
       │     o            expand / collapse messages (reader)                               │       
       │     O            open in Gmail on the web                                          │       
       │                                                                                    │       
       │   Everywhere                                                                       │       
       │     /            search all mail                                                   │       
       │     gi gs gt…    go to Inbox, Starred, Sent, Drafts, All mail, Trash               │       
       │     s            sync now                                                          │       
       │     [            previous account                                                  │       
       │     ]            next account                                                      │       
       │     b            show / hide mailboxes (wide screens)                              │       
       │     ?            help                                                              │       
       │     q            quit                                                              │       
       │                                                                                    │       
       │   gi Inbox · gs Starred · gt Sent · gd Drafts · ga All mail · g# Trash · g! Spam   │       
       │   Press any key to close.                                                          │       
       │                                                                                    │       
       ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯       